---
source: crates/odx-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Remove repositories no registered workspace uses, least recently used first

Usage: odx cache gc [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --max-size <SIZE>
          Keep the cache under this size (default: `[cache] max_size`; without one, remove every unused repository)

      --dry-run
          Show what would be removed

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version

Global options:
  -C, --project-dir <DIR>
          Run as if started in DIR

  -c, --config <FILE>
          The pyproject.toml to use (a repos.yaml for the commands that read one)

  -j, --jobs <N>
          Override the number of parallel jobs

      --offline
          Serve git repositories and forge and index data from the cache only; what is not cached fails. Local work (git, pre-commit, odoo-lint) takes as long as before

      --fresh
          Ignore cached data; refresh everything before answering

      --no-refresh
          Use cached data even when stale. Like --offline, this saves network time only

      --refresh-index
          Rebuild the addon index for the series involved

      --json
          Machine-readable output on stdout

  -v, --verbose...
          Say when each repository's fetch and build starts, and what each fetched and merged

  -q, --quiet
          Errors only on standard error: no progress lines, no warnings
